{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "menahariya-smart-api-full",
    "name": "Menahariya Smart API — Full",
    "description": "## Quick setup\n1. **Variables** → set `baseUrl` to `http://localhost:PORT` (match `.env` `PORT`, often 5000).\n2. Run **Auth → Login (save token)** with a real user, or **Login — Admin / Driver / Passenger** (edit phone/password in body first).\n3. **Tests** on Login saves `token` + `role_name` for Bearer auth on all other folders.\n4. Set **`routeId`, `vehicleId`, `tripId`, `seatId`, `userId`** to valid FKs before tickets/payments/cargo.\n\n## Full endpoint map (all implemented)\n| Area | Methods |\n|------|---------|\n| Health | `GET /` |\n| Auth | `POST /api/register`, `POST /api/login`, `GET /api/profile` |\n| Views | `GET /api/views/admin-dashboard`, `driver-dashboard`, `passenger-dashboard`, `tickets-relations`, `vehicles-relations`, `cargo-relations`, `seats-relations`, `relations-overview` (+ `?limit=`) |\n| Users | CRUD `/api/users`, `/api/users/:id` |\n| Roles | CRUD `/api/roles` |\n| Permissions | CRUD `/api/permissions` |\n| Role-permissions | `POST/GET/DELETE`, `GET .../role/:roleId` |\n| Login history | CRUD + `GET .../user/:userId` |\n| Routes (paths) | CRUD `/api/routes` |\n| Vehicles | CRUD `/api/vehicles` |\n| Seats | CRUD + `GET .../vehicle/:vehicleId` |\n| Trips | CRUD `/api/trips` (writes admin) |\n| Tickets | CRUD `/api/tickets` (QR on create/get) |\n| Payments | CRUD `/api/payments` |\n| Cargo | CRUD `/api/cargo` (fee from weight; admin `fee_override`) |\n| Cargo receipts | CRUD `/api/cargo-receipts` |\n| Notifications | CRUD `/api/notifications` |\n| Reports | CRUD `/api/reports` |\n\n## RBAC\n- **Admin**: full access to admin views + mutating protected resources.\n- **Driver**: driver dashboard; scoped trips/tickets/cargo/notifications.\n- **Passenger** (role names: passenger, user, customer, client): passenger dashboard; own tickets/cargo/payments; cargo **fee** = `CARGO_FEE_BASE + weight × CARGO_FEE_PER_KG`.\n\n## Suggested runner order (manual)\n1. Health → Login → Profile → Admin dashboard → Relations overview.\n2. Seed: Roles/Permissions → Routes → Vehicles → Seats → Trips.\n3. Tickets → Payments → Cargo → Cargo receipts → Notifications → Reports.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "role_name", "value": "" },
    { "key": "id", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "roleId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "permissionId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "vehicleId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "routeId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "tripId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "seatId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "ticketId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "cargoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Root",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Test Passenger\",\n  \"phone\": \"0911000001\",\n  \"email\": \"passenger@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role_id\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/register",
            "description": "Public. Set `role_id` to a real role id (e.g. passenger/user vs admin vs driver)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (save token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                  "  if (j.role_name) pm.collectionVariables.set('role_name', j.role_name);",
                  "} catch (e) {}",
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.code === 200);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"0912345678\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
            "description": "Change phone/password to a real user. Token is stored for Bearer requests."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/profile"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Admin (edit phone)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                  "  if (j.role_name) pm.collectionVariables.set('role_name', j.role_name);",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"ADMIN_PHONE_HERE\",\n  \"password\": \"YOUR_PASSWORD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login",
            "description": "Replace **ADMIN_PHONE_HERE** / password with your admin user. Saves token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Driver (edit phone)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                  "  if (j.role_name) pm.collectionVariables.set('role_name', j.role_name);",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"DRIVER_PHONE_HERE\",\n  \"password\": \"YOUR_PASSWORD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — Passenger (edit phone)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.token);",
                  "  if (j.role_name) pm.collectionVariables.set('role_name', j.role_name);",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"PASSENGER_PHONE_HERE\",\n  \"password\": \"YOUR_PASSWORD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Views (RBAC)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/admin-dashboard",
            "description": "Requires **admin** token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Driver dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/driver-dashboard",
            "description": "Requires **driver** token (`roles.name` = driver)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Passenger dashboard",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/passenger-dashboard",
            "description": "Requires **passenger** token (role name: passenger, user, customer, or client)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tickets relations (joins)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/tickets-relations?limit=50",
            "description": "**Admin.** Ticket → user, seat, trip, route, vehicle, driver, payment. `?limit=1–200`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Vehicles relations (joins)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/vehicles-relations?limit=30",
            "description": "**Admin.** Fleet summary + recent trips sample."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cargo relations (joins)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/cargo-relations?limit=50",
            "description": "**Admin.** Cargo → owner, trip, route, vehicle, driver."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Seats relations (joins)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/seats-relations?limit=100",
            "description": "**Admin.** Seat → vehicle; optional ticket/passenger/trip/route (multiple rows if seat reused)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Relations overview (all)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/views/relations-overview?limit=40",
            "description": "**Admin.** Bundles tickets + vehicles + cargo + seats relation payloads in one JSON."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"New User\",\n  \"phone\": \"0922113344\",\n  \"email\": \"new@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\",\n  \"role_id\": 2,\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users",
            "description": "**Admin only**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users",
            "description": "**Admin only**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get user by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}",
            "description": "Admin any id; others only **self**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update user (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Updated Name\",\n  \"phone\": \"0922113344\",\n  \"email\": \"updated@example.com\",\n  \"role_id\": 2,\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}",
            "description": "Admin must send `role_id` and `status`. Passenger updating self: omit role change in API — server keeps existing role/status."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete user",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{id}}",
            "description": "**Admin only**."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create role",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"driver\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/roles",
            "description": "**Admin only**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List roles",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/roles" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get role by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update role",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"passenger\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete role",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/roles/{{id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Permissions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create permission",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"book_ticket\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/permissions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List permissions",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/permissions" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get permission by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/{{id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update permission",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"cancel_ticket\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/{{id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete permission",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/permissions/{{id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Role permissions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Assign permission to role",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"role_id\": 1,\n  \"permission_id\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/role-permissions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List all role-permissions",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/role-permissions" }
        },
        {
          "name": "List permissions for role",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/role-permissions/role/{{roleId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove assignment",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/role-permissions/{{roleId}}/{{permissionId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Login history",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create login history",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": 1,\n  \"device_info\": \"Postman\",\n  \"ip_address\": \"127.0.0.1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login-history",
            "description": "**Admin only**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List login history",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login-history" }
        },
        {
          "name": "List by user",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login-history/user/{{userId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login-history/{{id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update login history",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": 1,\n  \"device_info\": \"Updated\",\n  \"ip_address\": \"192.168.1.1\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login-history/{{id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete login history",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/login-history/{{id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Routes (paths)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create route",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"origin\": \"Addis Ababa\",\n  \"destination\": \"Dire Dawa\",\n  \"distance_km\": 445.5\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/routes",
            "description": "**POST/PUT/DELETE admin.** GET allowed for authenticated roles."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List routes",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/routes" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get route by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/routes/{{id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update route",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"origin\": \"Addis Ababa\",\n  \"destination\": \"Hawassa\",\n  \"distance_km\": 275\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/routes/{{id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete route",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/routes/{{id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vehicles",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create vehicle (auto plate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"Toyota Hiace\",\n  \"capacity\": 14,\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles",
            "description": "Admin write. Omit `plate_number` to auto-generate."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create vehicle (custom plate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate_number\": \"AA-99999\",\n  \"model\": \"Bus\",\n  \"capacity\": 45,\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List vehicles",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get vehicle by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/{{id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update vehicle",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plate_number\": \"AA-12345\",\n  \"model\": \"Toyota Coaster\",\n  \"capacity\": 22,\n  \"status\": \"maintenance\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/{{id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete vehicle",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vehicles/{{id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Seats",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create seat",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicle_id\": 1,\n  \"seat_number\": 1\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/seats"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List seats",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/seats" }
        },
        {
          "name": "List seats by vehicle",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/seats/vehicle/{{vehicleId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get seat by id",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/seats/{{id}}" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update seat",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicle_id\": 1,\n  \"seat_number\": 2\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/seats/{{id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete seat",
          "request": { "method": "DELETE", "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/seats/{{id}}" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Trips",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create trip",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.id != null) pm.collectionVariables.set('tripId', String(j.id));",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"route_id\": {{routeId}},\n  \"vehicle_id\": {{vehicleId}},\n  \"driver_id\": {{userId}},\n  \"departure_time\": \"2026-04-01T08:00:00\",\n  \"arrival_time\": \"2026-04-01T18:00:00\",\n  \"price\": 450,\n  \"status\": \"scheduled\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trips",
            "description": "**Admin only** for create/update/delete. Set `routeId`, `vehicleId`, `userId` (driver). **Tests** saves response `id` → `tripId`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List trips",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trips",
            "description": "Admin: all. Driver: assigned. Passenger: scheduled/ongoing."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get trip by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}",
            "description": "Set `tripId` variable."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update trip",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
